# Module Catalog

This file owns shipped `module_key` values, package coverage, and status; seed only active modules from it.

## Rules

- Seed shipped active modules from this catalog.
- Default permissions must align with `permissions.mdc`.
- Package coverage must align with `subscriptions.mdc`.
- Reset must restore the shipped mapping atomically.
- Admin changes must stay auditable and versioned.
- Planned modules must not enter default seed data.

## Active Module Keys

`app_shell`, `auth_session`, `general_settings`, `tenant_settings`, `facility_settings`, `access_admin`, `subscriptions`, `rooms_beds`, `patient_registry`, `opd`, `triage`, `clinical`, `nursing`, `ipd`, `icu`, `theater`, `discharge`, `emergency`, `lab`, `radiology`, `physiotherapy`, `pharmacy`, `billing`, `accounts`, `claims`, `hr`, `biomedical`, `operations`, `housekeeping`, `mortuary`, `communications`, `reports_audit`, `integrations`, `demo_seed`.

## Finance module notes

- `billing` — cashier desk (`/billing`, subscription slug `billing-payments`): invoices, collect, claims handoff, price book.
- `accounts` — books desk (`/accounts`, subscription slug `facility-accounts`): journals, GL, patient ledgers, chart of accounts, period open/close. Not a Billing tab; Reporting & analytics owns period KPIs.

## Planned Modules

- `dental` (Custom/Pro+) is planned and must not seed as a standalone entitlement.
- `analytics`, `decision_support`, `workflow_engine`, `device_integration`, `marketplace`, `research`, and `ai_automation` are planned; must not seed them.

